    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block 17</strong> is a fantastic action game with elements of horror, created in a pixel-art style.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/7007036b4ccdbee22bc08143467cad2f.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/7007036b4ccdbee22bc08143467cad2f.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/7007036b4ccdbee22bc08143467cad2f.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Explore the Block 17</i> </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you must find a way out of a prison on the planet Mars, swarming with monsters. You will be accompanied by a bot, originally intended for repairs, but circumstances have forced it to become your assistant not only in repairing electrical networks but also in destroying disgusting creatures. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/6d39b556fda01cf0e4b02bb0cf660822.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/6d39b556fda01cf0e4b02bb0cf660822.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/6d39b556fda01cf0e4b02bb0cf660822.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Approach the situation creatively!</i></p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets, navigate the gloomy prison corridors, explore rooms, upgrade weapons and the bot's abilities, and maybe you'll be lucky in the next battle with the boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We strive to create a strong atmosphere of crushing horror in our game. Despite being a pixel-art platformer, we aim to make the game realistic, logical, and detailed, so the player feels immersed in a real world.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/3edc188058f0987d91cf84c625eb92e7.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/3edc188058f0987d91cf84c625eb92e7.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/3edc188058f0987d91cf84c625eb92e7.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Improve and use the bot!</i>  </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a mechanic summoned to a high-security prison on Mars to fix a malfunction in the electrical system. But as soon as he starts, the lights go out, he gets hit and loses consciousness, and when he wakes up, he finds himself in a prison swarming with creepy creatures. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dive into dark stories</i> </p><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened? How do you get out now? These are the questions you will have to answer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, we were inspired by well-known works of science fiction, but we tried to bring something new to our product. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Meet a variety of colorful characters Block 17</i> </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the hero will have to confront the artificial intelligence created to maintain order in the prison, as well as an intelligent biological substance trying to escape to the open settlement. As the game progresses, you will have to choose which side to take, and who knows where that choice might lead you. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71ce0433320f1e2d4069dcf.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71ce0433320f1e2d4069dcf.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71ce0433320f1e2d4069dcf.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Unexpected events may be waiting in every nook and cranny</i> <br><br><br> <br>Block 17 features many different enemies that will not only scare you with their appearance but also create numerous difficult situations from which the player must escape. We aim to create many unique enemies with distinct abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the game will have many secrets, hiding either interesting information or useful items, as well as environmental elements designed to shed light on what is happening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We put a lot of work into the visuals, as they are a huge part of the atmosphere. Even though the graphics are pixelated, we are constantly developing our own solutions to make the light and glare as spectacular as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, the development is in full swing. If you are interested in our project, please add the game to your wishlist and follow us!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block 17</strong> is a fantastic action game with elements of horror, created in a pixel-art style.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/7007036b4ccdbee22bc08143467cad2f.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/7007036b4ccdbee22bc08143467cad2f.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/7007036b4ccdbee22bc08143467cad2f.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Explore the Block 17</i> </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you must find a way out of a prison on the planet Mars, swarming with monsters. You will be accompanied by a bot, originally intended for repairs, but circumstances have forced it to become your assistant not only in repairing electrical networks but also in destroying disgusting creatures. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/6d39b556fda01cf0e4b02bb0cf660822.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/6d39b556fda01cf0e4b02bb0cf660822.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/6d39b556fda01cf0e4b02bb0cf660822.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Approach the situation creatively!</i></p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets, navigate the gloomy prison corridors, explore rooms, upgrade weapons and the bot's abilities, and maybe you'll be lucky in the next battle with the boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We strive to create a strong atmosphere of crushing horror in our game. Despite being a pixel-art platformer, we aim to make the game realistic, logical, and detailed, so the player feels immersed in a real world.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/3edc188058f0987d91cf84c625eb92e7.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/3edc188058f0987d91cf84c625eb92e7.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/3edc188058f0987d91cf84c625eb92e7.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Improve and use the bot!</i>  </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a mechanic summoned to a high-security prison on Mars to fix a malfunction in the electrical system. But as soon as he starts, the lights go out, he gets hit and loses consciousness, and when he wakes up, he finds himself in a prison swarming with creepy creatures. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dive into dark stories</i> </p><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened? How do you get out now? These are the questions you will have to answer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, we were inspired by well-known works of science fiction, but we tried to bring something new to our product. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.mp4?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Meet a variety of colorful characters Block 17</i> </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the hero will have to confront the artificial intelligence created to maintain order in the prison, as well as an intelligent biological substance trying to escape to the open settlement. As the game progresses, you will have to choose which side to take, and who knows where that choice might lead you. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71ce0433320f1e2d4069dcf.poster.avif?t=1750542642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71ce0433320f1e2d4069dcf.webm?t=1750542642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71c